Package: fpvscan
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Mythos <fpvscan>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-dev, python3-pip, build-essential, rsync, ffmpeg, libusb-1.0-0, adduser, udev, systemd, libbladerf2, bladerf, bladerf-fpga-hostedxa4
Description: Analog FPV video scanner (bladeRF) for Raspberry Pi 5
 Scans 400 MHz–6 GHz for analog composite FPV video and serves a web console.
 Bind address is 0.0.0.0:8080 so the UI is reachable via a ZeroTier IP.
